  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-popover-attribute\r\n\r\nThis was brought up by @rwlbuis. Seems like we don't account for changes done during the beforetoggle event in step 3:\r\n\r\n1. If namespace is not null, then return.\r\n2. If localName is not [popover](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-popover), then return.\r\n3. If oldValue and value are in different [states](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-popover), then run the [hide popover algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-popover-algorithm) given element, true, true, and false.\r\n\r\n\r\nSolutions could be:\r\n- Not firing events on attribute change (so this problem wouldn't appear)\r\n- Adding a special case after step 3",
